   "provenance": "All six arms measure the #671 round-5 firmware: the shipping writer's boot judges each slot on one staged read under a three-read bound, compares two refused reads by their byte count, a CRC-32 over all but their last four bytes and those four bytes, and holds the writer when a slot's authority is unknown; the console names the hold and each unread slot's cause; nvm_capture() and the census of #629 are unchanged. Processor pin 2ad2f845. The measured firmware and capture inputs are those of bd42818d; later test-only commits leave those inputs unchanged. The six arms ran with at most two concurrent builds; independent simulations overlapped. The capture SoC has no Milan MAC MDIO CSR, so the PHY path is compiled out. ARM through ATTEST contains no heartbeat or PHY call.",
